{
  "uid": "capiba-energia",
  "title": "Capiba — Energia (Kepler)",
  "description": "Potência (Watts) e energia (Joules) estimadas por pod do namespace capiba, exportadas pelo Kepler.",
  "tags": ["capiba", "energia", "kepler"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "refresh": "1m",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Sobre as estimativas",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Métricas do [Kepler](https://sustainable-computing.io/) (eBPF). **Em VM ou notebook sem contadores RAPL acessíveis, os valores vêm do power model do Kepler (estimativa por utilização de CPU) e podem ser zero** — trate como ordem de grandeza para comparar pods entre si, não como medição de tomada. Métricas: `kepler_pod_cpu_watts` (gauge) e `kepler_pod_cpu_joules_total` (counter)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Watts estimados por pod",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "watt"}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod_name) (kepler_pod_cpu_watts{pod_namespace=\"capiba\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Watts totais do namespace",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "watt"}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(kepler_pod_cpu_watts{pod_namespace=\"capiba\"})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Energia por pod (Joules/hora)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "joule"}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod_name) (increase(kepler_pod_cpu_joules_total{pod_namespace=\"capiba\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod_name}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
